        <summary>
          <para>A quality constant indicating a location provider may choose to satisfy this request by providing less accurate locations in order to save power. Each location provider may interpret this field differently, but as an example, the network provider may choose to return cell based locations rather than wifi based locations in order to save power when this flag is present.</para>
